"""
A facility is a structure within a [Site]({{Types.Site}}).
A facility owns one or more [SiteFacilityLayers]({{Types.SiteFacilityLayer}}), each a georeferenced
image that can be drawn over the site's map.
"""
type SiteFacility {
    """The unique identifier of the facility."""
    id: ID!
    """The name of the facility. Unique within its site."""
    name: String!
    """The site that the facility belongs to."""
    site: Site!
    """The image layers that make up this facility."""
    layers: [SiteFacilityLayer!]!
    """Additional metadata associated with the facility. This may represent any JSON object structure."""
    metadata: JSON
}

"""
A georeferenced image layer belonging to a [SiteFacility]({{Types.SiteFacility}}).
"""
type SiteFacilityLayer {
    """The unique identifier of the layer."""
    id: ID!
    """The name of the layer. Unique within its facility, case-insensitively."""
    name: String!
    """The facility that the layer belongs to."""
    facility: SiteFacility!
    """The URL of the layer image. Short-lived. Null until an image has been uploaded for the layer."""
    imageUrl: String
    """The geographic bounds that the layer image is stretched to."""
    imageBounds: GeoJSONPolygon
    """Additional metadata associated with the layer. This may represent any JSON object structure."""
    metadata: JSON
}

"""
Fields to create a new [SiteFacility]({{Types.SiteFacility}}).
"""
input CreateSiteFacilityInput {
    """The site that the facility belongs to."""
    siteId: ID!
    """The name of the facility. Must be unique within its site, case-insensitively."""
    name: String!
    """Additional metadata associated with the facility. This may represent any JSON object structure."""
    metadata: JSON
}

"""
Fields to update an existing [SiteFacility]({{Types.SiteFacility}}).
Omitted fields are left unchanged. A facility cannot be moved to another site.
"""
input UpdateSiteFacilityInput {
    """The unique identifier of the facility."""
    id: ID!
    """The name of the facility. Must be unique within its site, case-insensitively."""
    name: String
    """Additional metadata associated with the facility. Null clears the metadata."""
    metadata: JSON
}

"""
Fields to create a new [SiteFacilityLayer]({{Types.SiteFacilityLayer}}).
The layer image is uploaded separately, so a newly created layer has no image.
"""
input CreateSiteFacilityLayerInput {
    """The facility that the layer belongs to."""
    siteFacilityId: ID!
    """The name of the layer. Must be unique within its facility, case-insensitively."""
    name: String!
    """The geographic bounds that the layer image is stretched to."""
    imageBounds: GeoJSONPolygonInput
    """Additional metadata associated with the layer. This may represent any JSON object structure."""
    metadata: JSON
}

"""
Fields to update an existing [SiteFacilityLayer]({{Types.SiteFacilityLayer}}).
Omitted fields are left unchanged. The layer image is not affected.
"""
input UpdateSiteFacilityLayerInput {
    """The unique identifier of the layer."""
    id: ID!
    """The name of the layer. Must be unique within its facility, case-insensitively."""
    name: String
    """The geographic bounds that the layer image is stretched to. Null clears the bounds."""
    imageBounds: GeoJSONPolygonInput
    """Additional metadata associated with the layer. Null clears the metadata."""
    metadata: JSON
}
